---
source: crates/gwsim-data/tests/descriptions.rs
expression: "[render(\"ApplyCondition(to: Adjacent(Self), condition: Weakness, duration: Scaled(5, 15))\"),\nrender(\"RemoveConditions(from: Party, count: Fixed(99))\"),\nrender(\"RemoveEffects(from: TargetAlly, kind: Hex, count: Fixed(1))\"),\nrender(\"Interrupt(to: TargetFoe)\"), render(\"FailSkill(to: Target)\"),\nrender(\"KnockDown(to: Adjacent(TargetFoe), duration: Fixed(2))\"),].join(\"\\n\")"
---
Foes adjacent to you suffer weakness for 5…15 seconds.
Remove 99 conditions from all party members.
Remove 1 hex from target ally.
Interrupt target foe.
The skill target is using fails.
Target foe and adjacent foes are knocked down for 2 seconds.
